# Unit17
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit17核心词汇

sustain/səˈsteɪn/维持；遭受/The country sustained heavy losses in the war.
symbol/ˈsɪmbl/象征/The dove is a symbol of peace.
sympathy/ˈsɪmpəθi/同情/She expressed sympathy for the victims.
symptom/ˈsɪmptəm/症状/Fever is a common symptom of the flu.
tackle/ˈtækl/处理/We need to tackle this problem immediately.
target/ˈtɑːrɡɪt/目标/The company set a sales target for the year.
technique/tekˈniːk/技术/She learned a new painting technique.
temporary/ˈtempəreri/暂时的/This is only a temporary solution.
tendency/ˈtendənsi/倾向/There is a tendency for prices to rise in winter.
terminal/ˈtɜːrml/终点；终端/The airport terminal is very modern.
territory/ˈterətɔːri/领土/The country defended its territory fiercely.
threat/θret/威胁/Pollution is a threat to public health.
thrive/θraɪv/繁荣/The business has thrived in recent years.
tight/taɪt/紧的/The deadline is very tight.
tolerate/ˈtɑːləreɪt/容忍/I can't tolerate such behavior.
torture/ˈtɔːrtʃər/折磨/He was tortured for information.
tough/tʌf/艰难的/It was a tough decision to make.
trace/treɪs/追踪；痕迹/The police traced the call to a hotel.
tradition/trəˈdɪʃn/传统/It is a tradition to eat dumplings on New Year's Eve.
tragic/ˈtrædʒɪk/悲剧的/The accident had tragic consequences.
trait/treɪt/特征/Honesty is an admirable trait.
transaction/trænˈzækʃn/交易/The bank handles thousands of transactions daily.
transform/trænsˈfɔːrm/转变/Technology has transformed our lives.
transmit/trænzˈmɪt/传输/The disease is transmitted through water.
transparent/trænsˈpærənt/透明的/The government should be transparent about its decisions.
transport/ˈtrænspɔːrt/运输/Public transport is very convenient in this city.
trap/træp/陷阱；困住/The fox was caught in a trap.
tremendous/trɪˈmendəs/巨大的/She made a tremendous effort to finish the project.
trend/trend/趋势/There is a growing trend toward online shopping.
trial/ˈtraɪəl/审判；试验/The trial lasted for three weeks.
trigger/ˈtrɪɡər/引发/The crisis triggered a wave of protests.
triumph/ˈtraɪʌmf/胜利/Her victory was a triumph of determination.
tropical/ˈtrɑːpɪkl/热带的/The island has a tropical climate.
trust/trʌst/信任/Trust is the foundation of any relationship.
ultimate/ˈʌltɪmət/最终的/This is the ultimate goal of the project.
undergo/ˌʌndərˈɡoʊ/经历/The country is undergoing rapid changes.
underlie/ˌʌndərˈlaɪ/构成…的基础/Several factors underlie this problem.
undertake/ˌʌndərˈteɪk/承担/She undertook the task with enthusiasm.
unemployment/ˌʌnɪmˈplɔɪmənt/失业/Unemployment has risen sharply.
uniform/ˈjuːnɪfɔːrm/制服；一致的/The students wear school uniforms.
unique/juˈniːk/独特的/Each person has a unique fingerprint.
universal/ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːrsl/普遍的/Healthcare should be a universal right.
update/ʌpˈdeɪt/更新/Please update your contact information.
upgrade/ʌpˈɡreɪd/升级/They upgraded the computer system.
uphold/ʌpˈhoʊld/维护/The court upheld the original verdict.
urban/ˈɜːrbən/城市的/Urban areas have more job opportunities.
urge/ɜːrdʒ/催促/She urged him to see a doctor.
utilize/ˈjuːtəlaɪz/利用/We should utilize all available resources.
valid/ˈvælɪd/有效的/Your passport is no longer valid.
vanish/ˈvænɪʃ/消失/The magician made the rabbit vanish.
